# Opening comms on the overworld. Each cue ends before the next mission.
~ mission_1

Comms: Well that was fast. Citadel approaches. Their mechs are already on the streets.
Comms: Move beside one and the fight starts right there.
Comms: Fight as a squad, you'll be at a disadvantage if you attack alone.
Comms: Clear every hostile and this mission is done. Then we can head back to base.
=> END

~ mission_2

Comms: Rain's on the bridge. Red corp holds the far bank.
Comms: Their grunts, flyers, and the boss shoot from two cells out. The quad never fires. When it acts, every red mech gains barrier.
Comms: Spread the squad. A line of them will rake anyone who bunches up.
Comms: Clear the bridge and we pull back to base.
=> END
